---
layout: layout.jinja
title: Careers
description: Work at Squatch Snacks. Openings in our Bend kitchen, our warehouse and on the trail.
permalink: /careers/
---
<Section id="openings" level="1" title="Join the search party" intro="We're a small team in Bend, Oregon, and on trails all over the West. Here's who we're looking for right now.">
	<div class="grid">
		{%- for job in collections.jobs | reverse %}
		<Card level="2" title="{{ job.data.title }}" href="{{ job.url }}" image="{{ job.data.picture }}" alt="{{ job.data.pictureAlt }}" eyebrow="{{ job.data.team }} · {{ job.data.type }}">
			<p class="muted">{{ job.data.location }}</p>
			<p>{{ job.data.summary }}</p>
		</Card>
		{%- endfor %}
	</div>
</Section>

<Section id="team-says" title="From the team" tone="raised">
	<Testimonial name="Rosa M." where="Trail Ambassador since 2023">The best part of the job is the look on a hiker's face when you hand them Pine Cone Crunch at mile 18.</Testimonial>
</Section>
